text:
Sandig sa DCC, ginmanduan ni Duterte ang mga myembro sang DDS (Davao Death Squad) kag ang National Network nga i-komiter ang mga krimen nga nakabutang sa Counts 1-3 nga amo ang masunod:

a. Count 1: Murders in or around Davao City during the Mayoral period by the DDS;

b. Count 2: Murders of High-Value Targets during the Presidential period;

c. Count 3: Murders and attempted murders in barangay clearance operations during the Presidential period”

Covered sang kaso ang Nobyembre 1, 2011 tubtub sa Marso 16, 2019.

english:
According to the DCC, Duterte ordered members of the DDS (Davao Death Squad) and the National Network to commit the crimes listed in Counts 1-3 as follows:

a. Count 1: Murders in or around Davao City during the Mayoral period by the DDS;

b. Count 2: Murders of High-Value Targets during the Presidential period;

c. Count 3: Murders and attempted murders in barangay clearance operations during the Presidential period”

The case covers November 1, 2011 to March 16, 2019.
